    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0109_f7613eed0fa1.png\" style=\"width: 252px; height: 199px;\" /></p><p>The given reaction can occur in the presence of :</p><p>(a) Bromine water</p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CS</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>273</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>FeBr</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p>(d) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CHCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>273</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
